{
  "slug": "mdbrain",
  "name": "Mdbrain",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "A native Claude Code extension that prevents AI from over-refactoring your intentional code. Combines XML-structured protocols (BRAIN/CRAFT/PERF) with a 16-entry false-positive catalog, enforced by a five-layer Safety Net: permissions deny list, PreToolUse hook, tool-scoped subagents, path-scoped rules, and behavioral protocols. Coexists non-destructively with existing CLAUDE.md and memory/.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **3 agents**, **3 commands** and **1 hook**.\n\n- **Agents** (3): `brain-router` (Use PROACTIVELY for ambiguous or compound code-quality requests), `craft-specialist` (Structural refactor agent), `perf-specialist` (Performance optimization agent)\n- **Commands** (3): `brain-scan` (Map the project's MD ecosystem and propose next steps), `craft-audit` (Scan the codebase for anti-patterns per CRAFT.md (read-only, no edits)), `perf-audit` (Baseline measurements + Top 5 bottlenecks per PERF.md (measurement-only, no edits))\n- **Hooks** (1): `PreToolUse`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install mdbrain@claude-community` from `chanjoongx/mdbrain`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "agent": 3,
    "hook": 1,
    "command": 3
  },
  "sourceType": "community",
  "author": {
    "name": "CJ Kim",
    "url": "https://github.com/chanjoongx"
